            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/665950/extras/f0684856b75c2716b5deb3a2fd8c1b92.avif?t=1761157240\" width=1536 height=256 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Drift, speed, and crush pumpkins on the creepiest tracks in the official Halloween racing game!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Creepy Races</i> is a fast-paced arcade driving game where you take control of a vintage rally car and race through narrow, twisting roads filled with pumpkins and sharp curves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t be fooled by its hand-painted look — this is a real challenge! Mastering every drift and earning five stars on all tracks will test your reflexes and your control behind the wheel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/665950/extras/8f8b031f62bbc536b1ec752bb967e6ca.poster.avif?t=1761157240\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/665950/extras/8f8b031f62bbc536b1ec752bb967e6ca.webm?t=1761157240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/665950/extras/8f8b031f62bbc536b1ec752bb967e6ca.mp4?t=1761157240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the <strong>18 handcrafted maps</strong> lasts between <strong>1 and 3 minutes</strong>.<br>Your <strong>final score</strong> depends on:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your total time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pumpkins you crush</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The checkpoints you’ve retried</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus points for drifting and flying through the air</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every drift counts — the faster and smoother you drive, the higher your score climbs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Retry System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press <strong>R</strong> or <strong>Y</strong> on your keyboard, or Y/<strong>△ </strong>on your controller, to instantly return to the <strong>last checkpoint</strong> and retry that section.<br>Perfect your run, improve your time, and chase the ultimate score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Difficulty</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can adjust the <strong>maximum speed</strong> to fit your skill level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take it easy and enjoy the ride — even your grandma could play — or push the pedal to the floor and face the full Halloween chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, responsive arcade driving with tons of drifting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 short but challenging circuits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-painted spooky visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pumpkins everywhere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to play, hard to master</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/665950/extras/f0684856b75c2716b5deb3a2fd8c1b92.avif?t=1761157240\" width=1536 height=256 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Drift, speed, and crush pumpkins on the creepiest tracks in the official Halloween racing game!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Creepy Races</i> is a fast-paced arcade driving game where you take control of a vintage rally car and race through narrow, twisting roads filled with pumpkins and sharp curves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t be fooled by its hand-painted look — this is a real challenge! Mastering every drift and earning five stars on all tracks will test your reflexes and your control behind the wheel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/665950/extras/8f8b031f62bbc536b1ec752bb967e6ca.poster.avif?t=1761157240\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/665950/extras/8f8b031f62bbc536b1ec752bb967e6ca.webm?t=1761157240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/665950/extras/8f8b031f62bbc536b1ec752bb967e6ca.mp4?t=1761157240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the <strong>18 handcrafted maps</strong> lasts between <strong>1 and 3 minutes</strong>.<br>Your <strong>final score</strong> depends on:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your total time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pumpkins you crush</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The checkpoints you’ve retried</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus points for drifting and flying through the air</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every drift counts — the faster and smoother you drive, the higher your score climbs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Retry System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press <strong>R</strong> or <strong>Y</strong> on your keyboard, or Y/<strong>△ </strong>on your controller, to instantly return to the <strong>last checkpoint</strong> and retry that section.<br>Perfect your run, improve your time, and chase the ultimate score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Difficulty</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can adjust the <strong>maximum speed</strong> to fit your skill level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take it easy and enjoy the ride — even your grandma could play — or push the pedal to the floor and face the full Halloween chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, responsive arcade driving with tons of drifting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 short but challenging circuits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-painted spooky visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pumpkins everywhere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to play, hard to master</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
