                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It was a fun game where you run over pumpkins in all the levels and then you play them in reverse. If you play all the maps you will probably be able to get all of the achievements and take a couple more minutes to find the golden treasure. The driving is a tad slippery BUT you get the hang of it after a race or two. The game looks & sounds great, going through the woods and a cemetery will definitely get you into the Halloween spirit. \n\nHere is my play through and all the achievements if you are having trouble:\n\nhttps://youtu.be/3CIqVO-79Lg",
